# DGTL Pay — Netlify headers
# STAGING: X-Robots-Tag keeps a preview URL out of search results while the product page has
# no canonical home. DELETE that one line when the real domain goes live, then redeploy.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
